      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RACCOON ROGER (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with four wins and five minors from 12 tries. Placed last time (21.93) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing third and beaten one length. Expected to be in the finish. MISS PUMPKIN (8) three runs back clocked a solid 21.92 win over 380m at this track then has found the minor money in two runs since. Should be in this for a long way. ASCEND KALMIA (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (22.38) in a OPEN at this track. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BUG ME MORE (6) is a surprise last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
